 68	
 69	**Event Firing Behavior:**
 70	- `ChangeDetected` fires when `PluginsFileChangedExternally` state changes **OR** when file signature changes; enables both main window state updates and automatic refresh of open diff windows.
 71	- Multiple subscribers can listen simultaneously (e.g., `MainViewModel` and `DiffDialogViewModel`).
