503	### `LoadOrderKeeper.Services.FileService`
504	
505	```csharp
506	public static class FileService
507	{
508	    public static bool DoesReferenceFileExist(AppConfigModel config);
509	    public static Task CreateReferenceFileAsync(AppConfigModel config);
510	    public static Task ApplyLoadOrderAsync(AppConfigModel config);
511	    public static Task<bool> HasPluginsFileChangedAsync(AppConfigModel config);
512	    public static Task<PluginsComparisonResult> ComparePluginsWithReferenceAsync(AppConfigModel config);
513	    public static Task<IReadOnlyList<ModDiffModel>> GetModDiffAsync(AppConfigModel config);
514	    public static Task<IReadOnlyList<ModEntryModel>> ReadModListAsync(string filePath, bool isReferenceFile = false);
515	    public static Task<bool> WouldSortingChangeDiffsAsync(AppConfigModel config);
516	    public static Task DiscardChangesAsync(AppConfigModel config);
517	    public static Task<bool> ReEnableModAsync(AppConfigModel config, string modFileName);
518	    public static Task<bool> RemoveNewModAsync(AppConfigModel config, string modFileName);
519	    public static Task<bool> ReplaceModWithNewAsync(
520	        AppConfigModel config,
521	        string removedModFileName,
522	        string replacementModFileName);
523	    public static Task<(List<string> AddedMods, List<string> RemovedMods)> CalculateReferenceChangesAsync(AppConfigModel config);
524	}
525	```
526	
527	**`ReadModListAsync`:** Thin public wrapper around the private `ReadFileAsync`. Reads a `Plugins.txt`-format file and returns its parsed entries as `IReadOnlyList<ModEntryModel>`. Pass `isReferenceFile: true` when reading the reference file so that entries are tagged accordingly. Used by `DiffService.GetPluginsDiffAsync` to load both the reference and current mod lists before passing them to `ComputeLcs`.
528	
529	### `LoadOrderKeeper.Services.DiffService`
530	
531	```csharp
532	public static class DiffService
533	{
534	    public static Task<IReadOnlyList<DiffLineModel>> GetPluginsDiffAsync(AppConfigModel config);
535	
536	    // Internal — accessible to LoadOrderKeeper.Tests via [InternalsVisibleTo]
537	    internal static List<(int refIndex, int curIndex)> ComputeLcs(
538	        IReadOnlyList<string> reference,
539	        IReadOnlyList<string> current,
540	        StringComparer comparer);
541	
542	    internal static List<DiffLineModel> ClassifyChanges(
543	        IReadOnlyList<ModEntryModel> reference,
544	        IReadOnlyList<ModEntryModel> current,
545	        List<(int refIndex, int curIndex)> lcs);
546	}
547	```
548	
549	**`ComputeLcs`:** Standard DP-based Longest Common Subsequence. Returns paired `(refIndex, curIndex)` indices in order, identifying which mods maintained their relative sequence between the two lists. The `comparer` parameter controls case-sensitivity — pass `StringComparer.OrdinalIgnoreCase` for the production path.
550	
551	**`ClassifyChanges`:** Classifies mod list differences using the pre-computed LCS as the "stable spine." Runs a 6-step pipeline: (0) build lookup sets, (1) detect shifted LCS items, (2) same-filename reconciliation → `Moved`, (3) LCS-aligned replacement detection → `Replaced`, (4) classify remaining new mods as `Added` or `Inserted`, (5) group shifted items as `DependentChanges` under their causal insertion/deletion. All `DiffLineModel` entries are constructed via `_localization.GetString()` — no hardcoded UI strings. Requires `ModEntryModel.LineNumber` to be populated before calling (guaranteed by `FileService.ReadFileAsync`).
552	
553	**Usage contract:** `ClassifyChanges` is a pure function — no shared mutable state. Wire it into `GetPluginsDiffAsync` after calling `ComputeLcs`. These methods are the algorithmic core introduced in WP-001; pipeline integration into `GetPluginsDiffAsync` is completed in WP-002.
554	
